1	// rebis/translate.rs — Gene→Protein Translation Pipeline
2	//
3	// Port of rhr_p4rky/gene_to_protein_pipeline.py.
4	// Full bidirectional gene↔protein translation with Frobenius verification
5	// at every step: DNA↔mRNA→codon↔amino acid↔protein chain.
