2	//! Port of rhr_p4rky/pdb_validator.py
3	//!
4	//! Validates predicted protein contacts against PDB experimental structures.
5	//! Core operations: CA coordinate parsing, contact extraction, precision/recall,
6	//! sequence extraction, and Frobenius verification.
7	
